<title>ITALY: Olivetti remains suspended in Milan.</title>
<headline>Olivetti remains suspended in Milan.</headline>
<text>
<p>MILAN, Sept 19 - Shares in troubled high-tech group Olivetti were suspended again in the Milan Bourse pre-opening phase and a new attempt will be made at 1132 GMT after a 10-minute period of price-matching, the Bourse Council said.</p>
<p>Olivetti shares were earlier suspended limit up in pre-Bourse price-matching.</p>
<p>Screen-based trading on the stock exchange, halted in the morning due to a technical hitch, has now resumed.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
